    "body": "Retained R1 row-store evidence for issue #5056 and actual measured main commit `3325dfe77940fec8587d8b61b1ac4e0b2f72caca`.\n\nThe immutable text package, binary-member index, and SHA-256 ledgers are committed at `24ac6866992dd89ab222b8bf03d60e6c0c49a2d5`, under `docs/evidence/r1-row-store-5061/_artifacts/`. This release contains the original binary overlay referenced by those ledgers.\n\n- `binary-overlay.tar.gz`: 271,917,606 bytes\n- SHA-256: `60571ff052920fe7620c296a18d13a9aedc37854852626267cab9a033b3b8670`\n- Six accepted capture records and ten rejected historical probes retain their original classifications. Nine available original binaries are indexed in the overlay.\n\nThe final evidence report and fresh public replay receipts will be reviewed and landed through the evidence PR. Publishing this archive alone does not establish graph completion or public replay success.\n",
